SECTION 5: BIODIVERSITY
────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Two of our manufacturing sites border Ramsar wetland areas (Thailand and Brazil).
We have committed to no net deforestation in our supply chain by 2025.
Our land restoration programme rehabilitated 340 hectares in 2024.

