SECTION 9: CLIMATE RISK (TCFD)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────

We conducted a climate scenario analysis aligned with TCFD recommendations
using 1.5°C, 2°C and 4°C pathways.

Physical risks identified:
  - Coastal flooding at two manufacturing facilities (medium risk, 2050 horizon)
  - Heat stress on supply chain in Southeast Asia (high risk)

Transition risks:
  - Carbon pricing in EU operations (estimated USD 18M annual cost at USD 80/tCO2e)
  - Stranded asset risk for coal-dependent plants: USD 340M book value

Financial climate exposure: disclosed in our 2024 Annual Report, pages 78-94.

